Ethetool Options
================
Use either native *RHEL* interface file or system script.

``/etc/sysconfig/network-scripts/ifcfg-<interface>``
----------------------------------------------------
Put in the ``/etc/sysconfig/network-scripts/ifcfg-<interface>``::

 ETHTOOL_OPTS="<option> [<interface> [<arguments>]]
 # ETHTOOL_OPTS="$ETHTOOL_OPTS ; <option> [<interface> [<arguments>]]"
 
Example from the ``/etc/sysconfig/network-scripts/ifcfg-eth0``::

 DEVICE=eth0
 BOOTPROTO=static
 IPADDR=10.0.0.1
 NETMASK=255.255.255.0
 # ...
 
 ETHTOOL_OPTS="-K eth0 lro off"
 ETHTOOL_OPTS="$ETHTOOL_OPTS ; -G eth0 rx 4096 tx 4096"
 
``/sbin/ifup-local <interface>``
--------------------------------
Use the ``/sbin/ifup-local`` script branching on each interface::

 # /bin/sh
 
 case $1 in
 eth0)
   /usr/sbin/ethtool -K $1 lro off
   /usr/sbin/ethtool -G $1 rx 4096 tx 4096
   ;;
 esac
 
 # vi:ft=sh
 
The script **MUST** be placed in the ``/sbin`` directory otherwise won't
be run at all!

